From 440f7c3f56b71c64fd257e827d0f1ee87010a1da Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex <codex@invalid.local>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 19:54:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(claude): preserve bounded native response identities

Preserve actual Anthropic response IDs through the existing declared suppressed
extension item, retaining exact canonical BB turn scope and explicit unbound
coverage without changing provider requests, sessions, core or SDK contracts.

Bound ownership to 256 identities per resident SDK lifetime. Retain conflicts
and use the pinned SDK result-ordering premise plus native resident fences.
Cole explicitly approved this native-provider exception after plugin review.
